{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42953","headline":"邯郸侠少年 · 郑鏦","name":"邯郸侠少年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜渡浊河津，衣中劒满身。\n兵符劫晋鄙，匕首刺秦人。\n执事非无胆，高堂念有亲。\n昨缘秦苦赵，来往大梁频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑鏦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}